<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>

    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>My Portfolio</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet"
          href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.7.2/css/all.min.css">

    <style>

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: "Times New Roman", Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            background: #000;
            color: #fff;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        header {
            background: #111;
            padding: 15px 8%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #333;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        header h1 {
            color: #fff;
        }

        nav a {
            color: #ddd;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 20px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #fff;
        }

        .input {
            min-height: 500px;
            padding: 80px 8%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .input-content {
            width: 100%;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 300px;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 100px;
        }

        .input-text {
            text-align: left;
            padding-left: 10%;
        }

        .input h2 {
            font-size: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .input p {
            color: #aaa;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .profile-image {
            width: 250px;
            height: 250px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 3px solid #333;
            justify-self: end;
        }

        section {
            padding: 80px 8%;
        }

        h2 {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .about-card {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 750px;
            margin: auto;
            background: #111;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .about-card p {
            color: #ddd;
        }

        .project-skill-content {
            width: 100%;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 100px;
            align-items: start;
        }

        .skills,
        .projects {
            width: 100%;
        }

        .skills h2,
        .projects h2 {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .skill-card {
            width: 100%;
            background: #111;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .skill-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            background: #1a1a1a;
            border-color: #666;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
        }

        .skill-logo {
            font-size: 42px;
            width: 60px;
            margin-right: 15px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .skill-card:hover .skill-logo {
            transform: scale(1.15);
        }

        .html {
            color: #e34c26;
        }

        .css {
            color: #1572b6;
        }

        .java {
            color: #f89820;
        }

        .python {
            color: #3776ab;
        }

        .csharp {
            color: #68217a;
        }

        .project-card {
            width: 100%;
            background: #111;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .project-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            background: #1a1a1a;
            border-color: #666;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
        }

        .project-card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .project-card p {
            color: #aaa;
        }

        .contact-card {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: auto;
            background: #111;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .contact-card p {
            margin: 15px 0;
            color: #ddd;
        }

        .contact-card i {
            margin-right: 8px;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;
            background: #111;
            border-top: 3px solid #333;
            color: #aaa;
        }

        @media (max-width: 700px) {

            header {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 15px;
            }

            nav a {
                margin: 0 8px;
            }

            .input {
                min-height: 500px;
                padding: 80px 10%;
            }

            .input-content {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 30px;
            }

            .input-text {
                padding-left: 0;
                text-align: center;
            }

            .input h2 {
                font-size: 30px;
                text-align: center;
            }

            .input p {
                text-align: center;
            }

            .profile-image {
                width: 180px;
                height: 180px;
                justify-self: center;
            }

            .project-skill-content {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 40px;
            }

        }

    </style>

</head>

<body>

<header>

    <h1>MyPortfolio</h1>

    <nav>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#Projects">Projects</a>
        <a href="#Contacts">Contacts</a>
    </nav>

</header>

<section class="input">

    <div class="input-content">

        <div class="input-text">

            <h2>
                Hello, I'm <span>Bench Bacquian</span>
            </h2>

            <p>
                A passionate student who enjoys creating functional websites.
            </p>

        </div>

        <img src="https://images.esquiremag.ph/esquiremagph/images/2025/04/03/094a4972-1743641896.jpg"
             alt="Bench Bacquian"
             class="profile-image">

    </div>

</section>

<section id="about">

    <h2>About Me</h2>

    <div class="about-card">

        <p>
            I'm currently learning HTML, Java, CSS, and hopefully
            Python as my next language. I enjoy improving my
            programming skills every day.
        </p>

    </div>

</section>

<section id="Projects">

    <div class="project-skill-content">

        <div class="skills">

            <h2>Skills</h2>

            <div class="skill-card">
                <i class="fa-brands fa-html5 skill-logo html"></i>
                <span>HTML</span>
            </div>

            <div class="skill-card">
                <i class="fa-brands fa-css3-alt skill-logo css"></i>
                <span>CSS</span>
            </div>

            <div class="skill-card">
                <i class="fa-brands fa-java skill-logo java"></i>
                <span>Java</span>
            </div>

            <div class="skill-card">
                <i class="fa-brands fa-python skill-logo python"></i>
                <span>Python ( Learning )</span>
            </div>

            <div class="skill-card">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-code skill-logo csharp"></i>
                <span>C# ( Learning )</span>
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="projects">

            <h2>Projects</h2>

            <div class="project-card">

                <h3>Personal Portfolio</h3>

                <p>
                    A simple personal portfolio created
                    using HTML and CSS.
                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="project-card">

                <h3>Simple Calculator</h3>

                <p>
                    A basic calculator project for practicing
                    programming.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>

<section id="Contacts">

    <h2>Contacts</h2>

    <div class="contact-card">

        <p>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i>
            Email: Bacquianbench58@gmail.com
        </p>

        <p>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-phone"></i>
            Phone Number: 09944786308
        </p>

    </div>

</section>

</body>

</html>
